    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4473" root="ثغو" body-key="v">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اثغى</span></b>  <i>He made</i> a sheep or goat [&amp;c.] <i>to utter
the cry termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُغَآء</span>. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَتَيْتُهُ فَمَا أَثْغَى</span> <i>I
came to him and he gave not anything:</i> (K:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَمَا أَثْغَى وَمَا أَرْغَى</span> <i>and he gave not a sheep</i> or
<i>goat,</i> &amp;c., <i>that uttered the cry termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُغَآء</span>, <i>nor a
camel that uttered the cry termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُغَآء</span>. (TA.)

